        "username": "morph147",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/839c29/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-14T01:11:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"much0gust0\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n much0gust0:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm in Beijing, so the Nintendo livestream started at midnight here, but I had to stay up and see what they were planning for this year. I was definitely not disappointed! As soon as that little Samus lightning bolt blurred into view, I gave a yelp of excitement! Metroid Prime 4, people! So many fun, first-party games coming out for this fanboy to enjoy. Kirby, Mario Odyssey, 2 Metroids…sweet…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>agreed. Nintendo did a good job showing what the future of the switch could be. The down side is not much of it is coming out by end of year.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>in other news excited to see the ni no kuni 2 trailer. Loved the first one. Also the .hack announcement makes me excited, always loved the anime but never played the games due to difficulty of finding.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
